    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> Enhancer: Merged Approach using Vector Embedding for Reducing Large Language Model Hallucinations with External Knowledge
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rayhan%2C+N">Naheed Rayhan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ashrafuzzaman%2C+M">Md. Ashrafuzzaman</a>
      
