    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        TAMO: Fine-Grained Root Cause Analysis via Tool-Assisted <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> with Multi-Modality Observation Data in Cloud-Native Systems
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+X">Xiao Zhang</a>, 
      
